# ST3.g065: demo1 from 44.0 s, the zombies close, in the Classic box (960x600 shown 4:3)
# with the torches' flicker, gliding lights and smooth motion on, and still id's 72 Hz
# ticks (`clock id`). id's Brightness slider at 0.65.
#
# No narration: a breath after V3-29, the three settings so far on.

demo demo1 from 43.0

duration 4.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
clock id
hud off
cvar gamma 0.65
cvar r_torchflicker 1
cvar r_lerplightstyles 1
cvar r_lerpmove 1
cvar r_lerpmodels 1

sound on
events on
